Revision history for Langertha-Holmgang

{{$NEXT}}
  - Initial release
  - Langertha::Holmgang::Report: write and read the JSON report (holmgang_report 1,
    ADR 0006), merge reports without double counting, map cai-platform --report
    for the acceptance comparison
  - Simulator plugin contract (Role::Simulator, Role::AnswerWorld, Simulators
    registry) and the linux device simulator with the bash grammar, nftables
    evaluation and systemd calendar
  - Linux simulator: Prometheus/Alertmanager with promtool and amtool, sshd
    configuration and reload/restart, logrotate, accounts and sudo
    (Sim::Linux::Monitoring, ::Sshd, ::Logrotate, ::Accounts)
  - Simulators for device types routeros (RouterOS console: menus,
    print/add/set/remove/move, find, export, ping) and ios (Cisco IOS switch
    CLI: show, configure terminal, interfaces, VLANs)
  - Sim::Linux::Kubernetes: kubectl against a simulated cluster — stored
    resources, derived pods and status, endpoints, reachability, Ingress,
    cert-manager, RBAC
  - Sim::Linux parts Backup (tar, gzip, sha256sum, rsync, restic, cp
    attributes), Storage (mount, LVM, mkfs, resize, swap, partitions, mdadm),
    Dns (BIND: rndc, named-check*, dig, host) and Postfix (postconf, postmap,
    queue)
  - Linux simulator parts PostgreSQL (psql), MariaDB (mysql/mariadb/mysqladmin),
    Redis (redis-cli, CONFIG, INFO, BGSAVE) and RedisService (Redis from the
    service alone)
